Subject: [PATCH] v8: pending: 352e9c46c2 (M159 merge 5b7c1a1f0f, crbug
 585624828)

TurboFan fix from V8 main, merged to 15.9 (M159) and not yet to 15.6:
use TruncateFloat64ToInt64 instead of a reversible conversion when the
input may be -0 and the use identifies zeros. Same code diff as
upstream plus the mjsunit regression test; the upstream unittest
changes are not carried (different helpers in 15.6). Not in the 3.2.0
batch; the cache epoch is not bumped here. V8 gitlink unchanged.
